{"speciesId":375,"names":{"fr":"Métang","es":"Metang","en":"Metang","ja":"メタング"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"When two BELDUM fuse together, METANG is formed. The brains of the BELDUM are joined by a magnetic nervous system. By linking its brains magnetically, this POKéMON generates strong psychokinetic power."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"When two BELDUM fuse together, METANG is formed. The brains of the BELDUM are joined by a magnetic nervous system. This POKéMON turns its arms to the rear for traveling at high speed."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"The claws tipping its arms pack the destructive power to tear through thick iron sheets as if they were silk. It flies at over 60 miles per hour."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It floats midair using magnetism. Its body is so tough, even a crash with a jet plane won’t leave a scratch."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It floats midair using magnetism. Its body is so tough, even a crash with a jet plane won’t leave a scratch."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It is formed by two BELDUM joining together. Its steel body won’t be scratched if it collides with a jet."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It is formed by two BELDUM joining together. Its steel body won’t be scratched if it collides with a jet."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It is formed by two BELDUM joining together. Its steel body won’t be scratched if it collides with a jet."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"When two BELDUM fuse together, a magnetic nervous system places their brains in union."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"When two BELDUM fuse together, a magnetic nervous system places their brains in union."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il est formé de deux Terhal soudés. Son corps de fer résiste à un choc avec un avion à réaction."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It is formed by two Beldum joining together. Its steel body won’t be scratched if it collides with a jet."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il est formé de deux Terhal soudés. Son corps de fer résiste à un choc avec un avion à réaction."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It is formed by two Beldum joining together. Its steel body won’t be scratched if it collides with a jet."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It is formed by two Beldum joining together. Its two brains are linked, amplifying its psychic power."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It is formed by two Beldum joining together. Its two brains are linked, amplifying its psychic power."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il est formé de deux Terhal soudés. Son corps de fer résiste à un choc avec un avion à réaction."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Lo forman dos Beldum unidos. Puede chocarse con un avión sin que su cuerpo de acero sufra ni un rasguño."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It is formed by two Beldum joining together. Its steel body won’t be scratched if it collides with a jet."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"２匹の ダンバルが 合体した。 鋼の ボディは ジェット機と 衝突しても 傷つかない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il est formé de deux Terhal soudés. Leurs deux cerveaux étant liés, ses pouvoirs psychiques sont très puissants."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Está formado por dos Beldum unidos. Tiene dos cerebros, así que cuenta con poderes psíquicos amplificados."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It is formed by two Beldum joining together. Its two brains are linked, amplifying its psychic power."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"２匹の ダンバルが 合体した。 ２つの 脳みそが 連結したので サイコパワーは より 強くなった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lorsque deux Terhal fusionnent, un Métang apparaît. Les cerveaux des Terhal sont reliés par un système nerveux magnétique, ce qui permet à ce Pokémon de générer un puissant pouvoir télékinétique."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cuando dos Beldum se fusionan, forman un Metang. Los cerebros de los Beldum se unen mediante un sistema nervioso magnético y generan potente energía psicoquinética."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"When two Beldum fuse together, Metang is formed. The brains of the Beldum are joined by a magnetic nervous system. By linking its brains magnetically, this Pokémon generates strong psychokinetic power."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"２匹の ダンバルが 合体した 姿。 ２つの 脳を 磁力の 神経が 結ぶ ことで 強い サイコエネルギーを 生み出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lorsque deux Terhal fusionnent, un Métang se forme. Les cerveaux des Terhal sont reliés par un système nerveux magnétique. Ce Pokémon dirige ses bras vers l’arrière pour voyager à grande vitesse."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cuando se funden dos Beldum, uniendo los cerebros por un sistema nervioso magnético, se forma un Metang. Para desplazarse a mayor velocidad, este Pokémon echa los brazos hacia atrás."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"When two Beldum fuse together, Metang is formed. The brains of the Beldum are joined by a magnetic nervous system. This Pokémon turns its arms to the rear for traveling at high speed."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"２匹の ダンバルが 合体したとき ２つの 脳が 磁力の 神経で 結ばれる。 腕を 後ろへ まわし 高速で 移動。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Lorsque deux Terhal fusionnent, leurs pouvoirs psychiques sont doublés. En revanche, ils ne deviennent pas plus futés."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Al unirse dos Beldum, sus poderes psíquicos se duplican. No obstante, su inteligencia no se ve afectada."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"When two Beldum link together, their psychic power is doubled. Their intelligence, however, remains unchanged."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"２匹の ダンバルが 連結し サイコパワーは ２倍に。 ただし 賢さ自体は 変わっていない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il raffole des minéraux qui émettent des ondes magnétiques. Il peut s’élancer à la poursuite d’un Tarinor à 100 km/h."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Le encanta comer minerales con propiedades magnéticas. Puede rastrear a un Nosepass desplazándose a más de 100 km/h."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It adores magnetic minerals, so it pursues Nosepass at speeds exceeding 60 mph."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"磁力を 放つ 鉱物が 好物。 時速 １００キロで ノズパスを 追いつめるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Grâce à ses deux cerveaux, il peut déchaîner une puissante force psychique qui lui permet d’immobiliser ses proies."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"El poder psíquico combinado de ambos cerebros es tal que le permite paralizar a sus presas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"With its two brains, it fires powerful psychic energy to stop its prey in their tracks."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"２つの 脳みそから 強力な サイコエネルギーを 放射し 獲物の 身動きを 封じる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il parcourt le ciel à toute allure à la recherche d’une proie. Quand il en trouve une, il l’attrape avec ses griffes acérées et ne la lâche plus."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Surca el cielo a gran velocidad. En cuanto avista su presa, la agarra con sus afiladas garras y ya no se desprende de ella."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It flies at high speeds around the skies. When it finds its prey, Metang takes a firm grip with its sharp claws and never lets go."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"高速で 空を 飛びまわり 獲物を 見つけると 鋭いツメで がっちり つかんで 離さないのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Composé de deux Terhal réunis par l’attraction magnétique, ce Pokémon a vu sa puissance psychique doubler grâce aux deux cerveaux."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Está formado por la fusión magnética de dos Beldum. Al tener dos cerebros, sus poderes psíquicos se ven duplicados."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Two Beldum have become stuck together via their own magnetic forces. With two brains, the resulting Metang has doubled psychic powers."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"２匹の ダンバルが 磁力で くっついた。 ２つの 脳みそにより サイコパワーは ２倍に 強化。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ce Pokémon vole par magnétisme. Il poursuit ses proies en slalomant à toute allure entre les pics escarpés."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Levita gracias al magnetismo. Es capaz de sortear escarpadas montañas mientras vuela a altas velocidades en pos de su presa."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Using magnetic forces to stay aloft, this Pokémon flies at high speeds, weaving through harsh mountain terrain in pursuit of prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"磁力で 空を 飛ぶ。 険しい 山岳を 縫うように 高速で 飛行して 獲物を 追いつめる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":375,"moves":[{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",26],[23,